{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23004","headline":"初除官蒙裴常侍赠鹘衔瑞草绯袍鱼袋因谢惠贶兼抒离情 · 白居易","name":"初除官蒙裴常侍赠鹘衔瑞草绯袍鱼袋因谢惠贶兼抒离情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新授铜符未着绯，因君装束始光辉。\n惠深范叔绨袍赠，荣过苏秦佩印归。\n鱼缀白金随步跃，鹘衔红绶遶身飞。\n明朝恋别朱门泪，不敢多垂恐污衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}